        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "[quote=\"\"Spiff\"\"]\n\nReally, the thing you have to say about playing the expansion is that the cards were high quality?  That's it? ;)\n\n[/quote]\n\n\nWell, it's not like he hadn't played with the cards before - he just hadn't played with them printed on the actual cards with the artwork. So... Yeah. :)\n\nMind you, I'm still jealous. ;)\n\nRabit",
